Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.94,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,I, Grace, have a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.84,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,It's to surround myself with hot guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:11.12,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,and spend the rest of my life \Nliving comfortably on Santorini Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:17.07,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,And in order to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:22.13,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,I've gathered intel, put it to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:25.21,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,and then killed, killed, \Nand killed some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:31.65,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,Now, finally, my long-awaited dream \Nis almost within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.80,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,And she is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:38.64,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,If I can take Xue's head...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:43.78,DefaultItalics,GRACE {N},0,0,0,,I'll be living the good life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.23,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You just wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:34.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:38.47,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I can't fall asleep if you keep \Nstaring at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:38.47,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1227CD&}5{\c&H000000&}: What {\c&H1227CD&}You{\c&H000000&} Want to Protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:44.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But we have no way of knowing when that \Nscoundrel will next appear, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:50.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even a moment's lapse of attention on my part \Ncould be enough for her to dismember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.94,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I'm getting cut up into pieces now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:57.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That is why, until I can find out \Nmore about that woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:03:00.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I would like to be your bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:03.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Seriously? I really don't think I can sleep \Nlike this, so is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:09.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Then allow me to suggest a more \Nsleep-friendly option, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:10.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:18.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Lending you my lap would restrict my movement, \Nbut please allow me to share your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:21.97,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ugh... Why can't I just say no?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm more worried about you, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:29.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,She's more likely to be here \Nfor you than for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:33.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,For me... For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.15,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What's she so self-conscious \Nabout all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:39.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If I were to be attacked while asleep \Nby someone of her level,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:42.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'd be able to handle it, \Nwith one hand at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:43.11,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,With one hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:48.13,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,During the day, I only had \None small knife with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so I'm glad I was able to scare her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,O-Oh, so that's what you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:58.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm certain even she isn't foolish \Nenough to attack me directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:01.55,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Is Ms. Yuki actually really strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:04.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I have no idea how she found out about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:08.01,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It seems my past is catching up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:11.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And now I've involved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:15.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But do not worry, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:21.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This is my foremost area of specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:24.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:33.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,As the one who taught me what kindness is, \Nyou are a very important person to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:38.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,S-Still, I can't help \Nbut worry about you, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:44.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I know there's nothing I can do, \Nbut I don't want to lose you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:48.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Very well. I will bear that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:56.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's getting a little hot in here. \NI'm gonna open a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will open it for you, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:01.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,We cannot discount the possibility of a sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:05.20,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Is this what it's like for VIPs \Nwith bodyguards, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:11.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh... I-I smell Katsuda's Sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:14.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Are the neighbors having \Na midnight snack or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:15.96,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No... This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.67,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Judging from the direction of the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.63,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,the scent is coming from \Nthe front gate of this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.84,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:29.43,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You've certainly lost your touch, Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:36.56,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's not like you to fall \Nfor an easy trap like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:41.08,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're so distracted by this pretend family \Nof yours that you're making dumb mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.78,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I can't believe they used to call you \Nthe White Wolf of the Dragon's Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:47.36,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Now, now. Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:53.54,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You know even you can't kill me \Nbefore I put this kid's eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:55.54,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So be a good girl and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\pos(584,153)\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx85\fscy37}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(577,160)}...You.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx425\fscy37\pos(90,34)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(100,40)}Do you understand what will happen to you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:02.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\pos(570,18)\fscx368\fscy37}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.79,0:06:02.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(562.5,24)}if you lay so much as a finger on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx305\fscy37\pos(80,307)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(88,314)}I will make you suffer so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx385\fscy37\pos(514,75)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.29,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(510,81)}you'll wish for a death that never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx275\fscy37\pos(547,19)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.55,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(539,24)}So, are you ready to accept
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur0.5\bord1\p1\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\fscx322\fscy37\pos(49,285)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&H121512&\3c&HD0D4CF&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(54.5,292)}the consequences of your actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:15.52,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I-I see. It seems the White Wolf \Nhasn't completely lost her fangs yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.75,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is, I have business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:23.32,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's a very important matter. \NI simply must end your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.73,0:06:28.86,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,But with my strength alone, I wouldn't be \Nable to kill you, even in a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.28,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So I'll be borrowing this boy \Nfor just a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:35.49,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Come to the school tonight at 2 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:38.83,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll guarantee his safety until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:45.87,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,You were born to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:49.38,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,The stench of death forever clings to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:53.35,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,No matter how much you deny it, \Nyou will always be Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:58.31,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I know. I know, Mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:04.44,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,If he'd never met me, Master Hitoyoshi \Nwouldn't have had to face such danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:07.77,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,After all, this was a fleeting dream \Nfrom the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:11.45,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,You have the composure of one \Nwho doesn't see people as people—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.86,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,a brutal killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:18.49,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,There is no other way for you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.81,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I will kill that woman
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:23.13,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,and eliminate all traces of what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:26.36,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,After I've ensured Master Hitoyoshi's safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:29.82,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I will leave the country, \Nand everything will resolve itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:33.79,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,And then I will simply return to living as Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:36.74,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Without me in the picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:49.93,Flashback,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I know there's nothing I can do, \Nbut I don't want to lose you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.17,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,No, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:58.99,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,What I... What I wish for is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:02.62,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,The thing I want is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.93,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H70635A&\3c&H291E19&}Ogiso Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.40,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.11,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.04,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:38.33,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Being strung up really suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Like heck it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.48,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're right. Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:44.68,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,you'd look great in bondage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.25,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Wanna give it a try next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Pick a kink and stick with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:51.38,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:52.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:58.97,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I have your tiny little life in the palm \Nof my hand right now, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:02.98,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,A life so insignificant that if I decided \Non a whim to crush it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.85,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,it'd be gone, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:10.06,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,And you only have your Ms. Yuki to blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:13.86,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,How does it feel to have your life \Nin danger because of that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.95,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't you hate her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.95,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Aren't you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:20.41,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Aren't you disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:27.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No. To be honest, I'm really \Nscared right now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:31.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki told me she'd protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:36.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And the only thing I can do \Nright now is believe in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.37,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.81,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,How boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:43.08,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You've got more guts than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.40,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Even though you look like a hamster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.96,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.74,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Not just anyone can tame Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.57,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,In truth, I couldn't care less \Nwhether you live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:58.45,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I just want to kill Xue with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:02.82,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Sorry in advance if you get \Nkilled in the crossfire, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:05.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're scarier when you \Ntalk like that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:08.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And you keep mentioning this "Xue"...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Is that Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:14.50,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You were with Xue all this time \Nwithout knowing her true identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:18.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All I know is that she's a maid \Nand former assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.93,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.59,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.51,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:25.22,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:30.42,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I used to share my corner of the world \Nwith lots of real dangerous folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.04,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,but Xue was special even amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:38.86,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,She was a ruthless murderer with no mercy \Nfor anyone—a butcher who lived only to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:43.62,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The fourth of the Dragon's Nine:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.15,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Xue the White Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:50.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Th-The Dragon's Nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:54.98,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The most powerful clan of assassins in the world. They gather talented individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:57.14,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,from various countries and train them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:03.54,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's said that they're behind \Nevery major shakeup in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.64,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,But, precisely because they are \Nsuch a powerful organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:09.69,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,there are many groups who oppose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:13.94,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Put simply, if I can take the head of one \Nof their members—in other words, Xue—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:16.25,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,my reputation will skyrocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:22.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get the {\i1}real{\i0} good gigs—the high-\Npaying stuff—and make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:28.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... Who are we talking about again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.75,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Like I said, I'm talking about Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The Ms. Yuki I know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:35.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,is a supposedly 16-year-old high school girl \Nwho jumps and falls a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:39.66,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,is completely expressionless in one moment \Nbut super emotional in the next,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:44.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,naïve by nature but with a love for \Ntonkatsu sauce unmatched by anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.47,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:48.81,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,At first, I thought it was just \Nsomeone who looked like her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:52.97,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,so I observed her for about three weeks, \Nbut there's no doubt that she's Xue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.77,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The White Wolf of the Dragon's Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:58.41,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,When you guys were talking \Nabout marriage on the porch,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.80,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I thought about just shooting \Nyou both, there and then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:04.11,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... That conversation \Njust kinda got out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:04.99,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Stop blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:09.79,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I sort of understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.96,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,There's something off about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:17.61,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,No normal person would be able \Nto stay calm in a situation like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:22.86,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,let alone carry on a conversation with \Nsomeone who was prepared to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:28.08,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,There's something about him that isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:35.12,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Something that was able to thaw \NXue's ice-cold heart of a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.94,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,But that's even better for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:42.94,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,People become weaker the more invested \Nthey are in protecting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.90,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:48.86,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,And no one in our trade would be naïve \Nenough not to take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:52.66,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Assassins aren't honor-bound by rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:57.80,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,And that's why even I have a path to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:14.48,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Come to me, monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:24.82,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Become the first stepping stone \Non the road to my dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:29.93,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Cutting bullets in half as you run? \NWhat is this, an action movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:31.87,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.16,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,nothing I can't handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:40.34,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,One well-done maid, coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.42,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Whaddaya call this? "Better watch your step"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No... Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:49.05,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,My, did I overdo it a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:52.47,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure it'll take more than \None measly trap to kill Xue...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.44,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:08.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki! I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm glad you are, too, Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll save you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.35,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Ah, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:19.12,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,First you dodge my landmines, \Nand then you give me the cold shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:23.21,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That's not normal, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.84,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Xue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:32.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You sure are taking me lightly \Nby attacking me head-on, Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:37.02,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, was it "Ms. Yuki" now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:44.70,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I heard you kept your identity a secret, \Nbut isn't that because you still feel guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:47.21,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That's right, you're the great Xue,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:50.14,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,the youngest member of the \NDragon's Nine in history!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:54.99,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If he found out who you really were, \Nyou wouldn't be able to stay here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:59.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You wanted to be normal, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.51,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,There is no way you'd ever—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.51,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you quite finished talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi has school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:09.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Staying up any later than this \Nwould be bad for his health.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Let us finish as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.43,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnArial Black\c&H0878F1&\pos(107.5,64)\frz23.63\shad2\blur0.3}SNAP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.43,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnComic Sans MS\c&H782B7A&\bord1\blur0.3\frz15.97\pos(387.5,109.5)}MEOW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.64,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,"Master Hitoyoshi," "Master Hitoyoshi"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:28.19,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1612,1)\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H403D4A&\3c&HCFB5E9&\pos(505,10)}Ms. {\c&HF7F0DD&}Yuki's\N{\c&H3D25B5&}Happy Meal of {\c&H3D73D9&}Love
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:23.15,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right now, I am thinking of \NMiss Riko and Agemochitaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:26.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda's Sauce is also constantly on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:28.19,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Why does she hold them in such high regard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:32.20,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Goodness. You certainly \Nare taking this lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:36.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Is Ms. Yuki wary of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:38.97,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, or is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:45.26,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,that the great Xue is too cold-hearted \Nto mind the boy losing an arm or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:52.70,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hey! I've still got some fun in store, \Nso don't rush it, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,L-Laser sniper rifles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.79,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:04.65,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,As you can see, \Nif you resist even a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:08.11,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,dear Hitoyoshi here will be reduced to a torso!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:11.49,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So just behave and let me beat you to death—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.03,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:15.82,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,How can she just rush in \Nwithout a moment's hesitation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:19.45,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Xue the White Wolf \Nnever lets her prey get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:23.93,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Ha! I see! Some "normal" you wanna be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:27.04,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You didn't care one whit \Nabout the boy's life to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:29.63,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You really had me going, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:34.38,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If you want it that badly, I'll put some \Nnice, big holes into the boy's limbs...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:37.14,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,so you can hang him up to decorate your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.19,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,She used her knives to deflect the bullets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:53.29,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,I screwed up by adding the laser sights \Nto make it more threatening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:56.24,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,No, nobody would expect a stunt \Nlike that to even be possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:58.07,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,But I'm not out of options yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(238,1)\fs40\bord2\fsp2\fnArial Black\c&H630F31&\3c&H09050A&\pos(117,3)}CRACK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:03.58,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Mrow! My smartphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:07.00,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Member...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.38,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,of the strongest clan of assassins,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.59,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Fourth of the Dragon's Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:15.61,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,This is Xue the White Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:18.80,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.35,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,Not good! Not good! She's going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:32.14,DefaultItalics,GRACE{M},0,0,0,,I have no choice but to create \Nan opening and make my escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:35.32,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You think you can just kill me \Nand live happily ever after?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:38.53,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,No matter how much you try, \Nyou'll never be Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:40.40,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're Xue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.95,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You know it more than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:45.07,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You really are foolish, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:52.08,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,No one just quits a job like ours—\Nthe talented ones like you least of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.38,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:57.82,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,countless others will come after your head \Nto make a name for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.60,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Do you intend to kill all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:03.28,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Is that what you consider "normal"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:07.31,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:11.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That was my idea of "normal" until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.53,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The more I killed, the more recognition I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That was all I knew how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:20.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I thought that was the only place I belonged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:26.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But everything is different now. \NI won't kill anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:31.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And I won't let anyone die \Nbecause of me, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No matter what happens from here on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:42.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will do my best to protect the normal life \NI obtained of my own free will!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:51.79,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR {N},0,0,0,,Xue the White Wolf \Nnever lets her prey get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:54.69,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR {N},0,0,0,,She will chase them to the ends of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:19:02.20,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR {N},0,0,0,,No matter where you hide, she will emerge \Nfrom the darkness to slit your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.90,FlashbackItalics,MENTOR {N},0,0,0,,The strongest, most horrible assassin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:07.16,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Those rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:12.90,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,I thought they were tales told about her \Nexploits and methods of killing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:17.59,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,That's not it. She's probably just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:20.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:27.02,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,...a naïve, willful woman who won't \Nstop until she gets what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:28.56,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Just like back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:30.80,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,and just now, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:37.26,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,So if she really wanted me dead, \Nshe would have killed me a long time ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:44.83,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I really thought I was a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:48.41,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, man. I get to live after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.18,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Those two are really interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:20:00.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. That was one thrilling day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:04.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, I had faith that you'd come \Nand save me, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:12.82,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't apologize enough for involving you \Nin such a perilous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.55,0:20:16.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:22.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If it's what you desire, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:27.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I shall disappear from...
